== Trivia ==
* Orphan socks refer to socks that are missing their matching pair.
* [[anti:Orphan Socks|Orphan Socks]] originates from the ''Antibirth'' mod, and by extension, from the ''Community Remix'' mod for the flash version.
** In ''Antibirth'', it would allow Isaac to only take damage from {{r|Curse Room}} doors via exiting them, similar to [[flight]], and give {{C|Magdalene}} immunity altogether in {{chal|Cursed!}}.
** In ''Community Remix'', it was instead called ''The Socks''.<ref>https://web.archive.org/web/20221115035837/http://platinumgod.co.uk/old/index.html</ref>
* The "your feet feel stronger" part of the description is exactly the same as the description of {{t|Callus}}, which gives Isaac immunity to [[spikes]] and [[creep]].
* Orphan Socks is the rarest item that can be acquired from a {{E|Locked Chest}}, along with {{i|Lead Pencil}}.

